  "http_qwen3_8b_q4_k_m": {
    "note": "One client on the VM (scratchpad load.py): N /v1/completions requests at once, a fresh prompt each (~25 tokens), 128 greedy tokens; total_tok_s = generated tokens over the round's wall time, prefill and HTTP included. turing serve --backend libllama --max-batch-size 8 --ctx 8192 --threads 16 against llama-server -np 8 -c 8192 -t 16. A warm-up round, then rounds a and b.",
